msgstr "群組嘅私人訊息用唔到加密。"

#: plugins/omemo/src/ui/encryption_list_entry.vala:156
msgid "OMEMO is initializing, please wait a moment..."
msgstr "OMEMO 初始化緊，請等一陣…"

#: plugins/omemo/src/ui/encryption_list_entry.vala:166
msgid "OMEMO initialization failed. Please try again."
msgstr "OMEMO 初始化失敗。請再試。"

#: plugins/omemo/src/ui/encryption_list_entry.vala:194
msgid "OMEMO can't be used in public (non-members-only) rooms."
msgstr "公開聊天室（唔係只限成員）用唔到 OMEMO。"

#: plugins/omemo/src/ui/encryption_list_entry.vala:197
msgid "No other room members are available for OMEMO encryption."
